^{-1}

. After an adjustable delay, the excited Th

^{-}

ions were ejected out from the ion trap for population analysis using the photoelectron energy spectroscopy. Given that the time of flight

in the TOF mass spectrometer [36] is a fixed value for Th

^{-}

